# AI Support knowledge packs — generated from store/content/docs by
# `pnpm --filter backend knowledge:build`. NOT optional at release: without them
# `ingestDocPacks()` finds no pack directory, the retrieval index is empty, every
# question falls below the retrieval floor and escalates, and the symptom reads
# as "the AI does nothing" rather than as a missing build step. Ignored here
# because they are derived and ~1 MB of gzip; the release pipeline must build
# them. Output is byte-stable for an unchanged corpus.
/backend/knowledge/
/mobile
/old-mobile
/.playwright-mcp
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
